# Reference only. Do not install this file as another workflow.
# The reviewed manual entry is .github/workflows/private-research.yml.
# It defaults validate_only=true: public dependencies and synthetic checks only.
# validate_only=false requires private-storage environment review, trusted main,
# owner trigger, ASHARE_PRIVATE_RUN_APPROVED=1 and ASHARE_ACCEPTANCE_COMMIT equal
# to the exact approved commit. No automatic schedule is present.
# App installation is restricted to MatokiJZ/ashare-observer with Contents write
# and Metadata read. The App key belongs only in the protected environment's
# ASHARE_STORAGE_APP_PRIVATE_KEY secret; never paste a key into this reference.
# New private outputs use migration-acceptance and separate acceptance Releases.
# The workflow verifies Linux dependency hashes before creating its short-lived
# installation token. There is no public private-data cache or artifact upload.
# Environment markers do not attest server-side protection. Verify branch rules
# and the required user review in GitHub; an assistant must not approve the run.
# A green public/synthetic job does not establish live research or storage success.
